:"N","type":"state","rawContent":"陆驰看着屏幕上这几样重口味的菜系，想起早上在UCL路口分开时她那副乖巧的模样，无奈又纵容地摇了摇头。","roundId":"round_1780106346930_1yqdpd6ys","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18085},{"id":1780105404700,"sender":"them","text":"行，晚上做川菜。一会儿下课我去趟超市买鸡腿肉，给你做宫保鸡丁，再弄个清淡点的蔬菜汤。","timestamp":1780106370312,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"行，晚上做川菜。一会儿下课我去趟超市买鸡腿肉，给你做宫保鸡丁，再弄个清淡点的蔬菜汤。","roundId":"round_1780106346930_1yqdpd6ys","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18086},{"id":1780105404701,"sender":"them","text":"火锅留着明天我生日再吃。","timestamp":1780106373193,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"火锅留着明天我生日再吃。","roundId":"round_1780106346930_1yqdpd6ys","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18087},{"id":1780105404702,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1780106377405,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"早上在路口才给你换的软底鞋，自己心里有点数，别跟着程煦瞎跑。你这去一趟牛津，心都飞了吧？早点忙完给我发定位，我去火车站接你。要是程煦敢让你提一点重东西，我明天非弄死他不可。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"playful","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1780106346930_1yqdpd6ys","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18088},{"id":1780106378337,"sender":"them","text":"知意，我到Paddington车站了，你在哪呢？","rawContent":"知意，我到Paddington车站了，你在哪呢？","content":"知意，我到Paddington车站了，你在哪呢？","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:59:38.337Z","time":"09:59","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"npc_msg_1780106378328_0","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18089},{"id":1780106378811,"sender":"them","text":"陆哥没起疑心吧？他那个人精，我真怕他看出破绽。","rawContent":"陆哥没起疑心吧？他那个人精，我真怕他看出破绽。","content":"陆哥没起疑心吧？他那个人精，我真怕他看出破绽。","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:59:38.811Z","time":"09:59","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"npc_msg_1780106378811_1","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18090},{"id":1780106378849,"sender":"them","text":"我跟诺丁山那个黑胶唱片室的老板确认过了，下午场地空着，咱们直接过去布置。","rawContent":"我跟诺丁山那个黑胶唱片室的老板确认过了，下午场地空着，咱们直接过去布置。","content":"我跟诺丁山那个黑胶唱片室的老板确认过了，下午场地空着，咱们直接过去布置。","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:59:38.849Z","time":"09:59","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"npc_msg_1780106378849_2","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18091},{"id":1780106378881,"sender":"them","text":"你可千万别跟他说漏嘴去诺丁山了啊，不然我明天得被他暗杀。","rawContent":"你可千万别跟他说漏嘴去诺丁山了啊，不然我明天得被他暗杀。","content":"你可千万别跟他说漏嘴去诺丁山了啊，不然我明天得被他暗杀。","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:59:38.881Z","time":"09:59","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"npc_msg_1780106378881_3","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18092},{"id":1780105404703,"text":"我估摸着他猜出来一点了不过我给他说没准备啥稳了一下","sender":"me","time":"10:01","timestamp":1780106469996,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18093},{"id":1780105404704,"text":"没说没说只说了牛津","sender":"me","time":"10:01","timestamp":1780106479634,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18094},{"id":1780105404705,"text":"我信马上写完了","sender":"me","time":"10:01","timestamp":1780106485675,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18095},{"id":1780105404706,"sender":"them","text":"他那脑子，猜到一点也不奇怪。只要核心机密没泄露就行。","timestamp":1780106492335,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"他那脑子，猜到一点也不奇怪。只要核心机密没泄露就行。","roundId":"round_1780106485893_90n78i0rk","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"a987bc04-87f7-4bdb-a0f5-e377f70268c5","_id":18096},{"id":1780105404707,"sender":"them","text":"你信慢慢写，不着急。","timestamp":1780106495107,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"你信慢慢写，不着急。","roundId":"round_1780106